2%9E%E5%8A%A0%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E5%85%A8%E9%98%9F%E5%86%B0%E4%BC%A4%EF%BC%9B%E8%A2%AB%E5%8A%A8%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E5%86%B0%E4%BC%A4%E3%80%81%E5%85%A8%E4%BC%A4%E5%92%8C%E5%85%A8%E9%98%9F%E5%85%A8%E4%BC%A4%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E5%8F%AF%E9%99%8D%E4%BD%8E%E9%98%9F%E4%BC%8D%E4%B8%AD%E5%86%B0%E4%BC%A4%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%BF%85%E6%9D%80%E6%8A%80%E7%9A%84%E5%86%B7%E5%8D%B4%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%E5%8A%A0%E5%BF%AB%E6%95%B4%E4%BD%93%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E9%80%9F%E5%BA%A6%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1646829376159\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/03/09/50494840/54385f9c708c261352ca8823072f43f8_3740071207680304689.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>空梦 · 掠集之兽</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">最佳推荐武器，全方面提其高输出和辅助的能力，被动降低队伍必杀技的冷却时间，加快整体流程循环速度。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/02/26/50494840/90f460b6f0040d2d917ae993348e677b_4037389185184944013.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">冰伤通用向超限环刃武器，必杀技/离场时生成结晶增加输出能力，同时提高全队冰伤；被动提高冰伤、全伤和全队全伤，且可降低队伍中冰伤特性角色必杀技的冷却时间，加快整体流程循环速度。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/02/26/50494840/90f460b6f0040d2d917ae993348e677b_4037389185184944013.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
